<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill Lynch starts.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill Lynch starts.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs analyst Richard Strauss has started coverage of Merrill Lynch and Co Inc and added the company to Goldman Sach's recommended list, a Goldman Sachs source said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares closed at 88 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
